{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jenny's Adventure is a 2D platformer where you guide Jenny, a cat, through an interconnected world of biomes. Use abilities like wall jumps and sprints while managing stamina to explore and collect flowers. Focused on platforming and discovery, it offers a relaxing, combat-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/Aesthetics_small.gif?t=1744345662\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration:</strong> With a heavy emphasis on exploration and discovery, Jenny's Adventures is a metroidvania filled with unlockable abilities and secrets. Find your way to the summit using your curiosity as the guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features an interconnected world with different biomes. Uncover a world with areas like forests and beaches. Use your skills to tackle several platforming puzzles to find the path to an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jumping:</strong> Jenny's Adventures uses a slightly different approach to jumping which is commonly seen in traditional platformers. Player needs to hold the jump button and then release it. If the player releases in a specific window, it results in a 'perfect jump' which increases the jump height.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game also features a stamina system. Some abilities like sprinting consumes stamina which can be refilled by collecting flowers or perfect jumps.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149660?t=1744345662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3149660?t=1744345662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/f3a5d1698c8a1c3af49f7d9ef29b02811b55c5de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744345662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/f3a5d1698c8a1c3af49f7d9ef29b02811b55c5de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744345662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jenny's Adventure is a 2D platformer where you guide Jenny, a cat, through an interconnected world of biomes. Use abilities like wall jumps and sprints while managing stamina to explore and collect flowers. Focused on platforming and discovery, it offers a relaxing, combat-free experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149660/extras/Aesthetics_small.gif?t=1744345662\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploration:</strong> With a heavy emphasis on exploration and discovery, Jenny's Adventures is a metroidvania filled with unlockable abilities and secrets. Find your way to the summit using your curiosity as the guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features an interconnected world with different biomes. Uncover a world with areas like forests and beaches. Use your skills to tackle several platforming puzzles to find the path to an area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jumping:</strong> Jenny's Adventures uses a slightly different approach to jumping which is commonly seen in traditional platformers. Player needs to hold the jump button and then release it. If the player releases in a specific window, it results in a 'perfect jump' which increases the jump height.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game also features a stamina system. Some abilities like sprinting consumes stamina which can be refilled by collecting flowers or perfect jumps.</p>","developers":["Pranav Gaur"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"des